          "text": "Keristrasza is a dragon imprisoned by Malygos after refusing to serve him. If freed, she draws on what she learned during captivity to help Raelorasz and her rescuer prepare against Malygos, though she remains weakened. She seeks Saragosa's death for the suffering Saragosa inflicted on her, and treats her rescuer as a dear friend she hopes to repay.",
